  "Entries": [
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00000_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "C'monnn, let there be a full-course meal tonight!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00001_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I see your wishes are extravagant as ever.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00002_KAsakura",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Look. There's something you don't see every day.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00003_TTojo",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "A portable stove and a grill plate?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00004_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "Next to red meat... It's BBQ!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00005_TKunimi",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "Yaaay!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00006_MAikawa",
      "Context": "Adv.playCutIn:3",
      "Original": "I'm so psyched right now!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00007_YIzumi",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "To think they'd let us grill our own meat... That's cool.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00008_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "It's a reward for all the hard work we 31-A put in!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00009_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Bwa ha ha! Once more, I laugh at you single-celled imbeciles...for we have ze same meaty meal!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00010_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talk:1",
      "Original": "That voice... It's Wakkie!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00011_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Don't CALL me that! It insults my sensibilities!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00012_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I guess this is a special treat for everyone, then.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00013_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "You'd better grill like you mean it! Bwa ha ha!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00014_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Master, there're too many options. I can't choose, <i>snip snip</i>!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00015_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Good grief! Surely you can choose your own sustenance?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00016_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Choose for me, <i>snip</i>!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00017_BIYamawaki",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "I vould if I could, my minion...but even I'M having a hard time deciding!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00018_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "You too, Master?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00019_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Ugh, I can't take this anymore. Allow an expert to show you the ropes.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00020_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "What was that, peasant?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00021_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "First, do you like fatty meat? Or meat on the lighter side?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00022_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Fatty meat all the way, <i>snip snip</i>!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00023_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "In that case...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:0",
      "Original": "If you're looking for fatty meat...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:1",
      "Original": "Try some red meat|Try some organ meat|Try some veggies",
      "Vietnamese": ""
