      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00024_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Try red meat.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00025_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "Red meat! Does this red one count as red meat, <i>snip snip</i>?!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00026_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "That'll do it.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00027_YBungo",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "But these all look so different, <i>snip</i>!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_MC02_07_09_00_Novel_00028_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacial:3",
      "Original": "And out of those, I recommend...",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:0",
      "Original": "What do I recommend for red meat?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:1",
      "Original": "Rib meat|Skirt steak|Tongue",
      "Vietnamese": ""
